  "meta": {
    "name": "TAMAM Design Tokens",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "brand": "TAMAM / \u062a\u0645\u0627\u0645",
    "identity": "From the brand sheet, verbatim and non-negotiable: primary #5B32F6, secondary #3D1ECF, accent #FFC107, light #F2ECFF, surface #F6F6FB, white #FFFFFF. Type is Poppins Rounded (Poppins is the shipping face) with Tajawal as its Arabic companion. Everything else in this file is derived from those and must bend to them, never the reverse.",
    "note": "Single source of truth. Never hardcode colours in apps \u2014 generate ts/dart outputs with `pnpm tokens:generate`.",
    "accessibility": "Every foreground/background pair the UI actually renders is verified against WCAG 2.1 AA in BOTH modes by packages/ui-tokens/scripts/verify-contrast.mjs, which runs in `pnpm tokens:generate`. Body text >= 4.5:1, large text, icons and UI borders >= 3:1.",
    "yellowRule": "Brand accent #FFC107 reads 1.63:1 on white: it is a SURFACE carrying ink-dark content (the sheet's yellow CTA with dark label), or a foreground on dark ground. For yellow type or a yellow rule on a light surface use accentInk / accentRule, the same hue carried down until it passes."
  },
